msgstr "Updaten"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6843
msgid "A newer copy from USB; its saves and settings stay"
msgstr ""
"Een nieuwere kopie vanaf USB; opgeslagen gegevens en instellingen blijven"

#. A menu row's name (about 30 characters fit).
